          "Agency ends by completion, expiration, mutual agreement, revocation, renunciation, or death/incapacity — not merely because the market is slow."),
        q(24, .agency, "When an agent represents the principal's interests to a third party with the principal's authority, this is best described as:",
          ["A general partnership", "A fiduciary relationship", "A customer relationship", "An arm's-length sale"], 1,
          "Agency is a fiduciary relationship — the agent must act in the principal's best interest with utmost good faith."),
